    "items": [
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Al director musical. Sígase la tonada de «La muerte del hijo». Salmo de David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Álef"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Quiero alabarte, Señor, con todo el corazón,",
          "y contar todas tus maravillas."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Quiero alegrarme y regocijarme en ti,",
          "y cantar salmos a tu nombre, oh Altísimo."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Bet"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Mis enemigos retroceden;",
          "tropiezan y perecen ante ti."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Porque tú me has hecho justicia, me has vindicado;",
          "tú, juez justo, ocupas tu trono."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Guímel"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Reprendiste a los paganos, destruiste a los malvados;",
          "¡para siempre borraste su memoria!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Desgracia sin fin cayó sobre el enemigo;",
          "arrancaste de raíz sus ciudades,",
          "y hasta su recuerdo se ha desvanecido."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "He"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Pero el Señor reina por siempre;",
          "para emitir juicio ha establecido su trono."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Juzgará al mundo con justicia;",
          "gobernará a los pueblos con equidad."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Vav"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "El Señor es refugio de los oprimidos;",
          "es su baluarte en momentos de angustia."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "En ti confían los que conocen tu nombre,",
          "porque tú, Señor, jamás abandonas a los que te buscan."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Zayin"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Cantad salmos al Señor, el rey de Sión;",
          "proclamad sus proezas entre las naciones."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "El vengador de los inocentes se acuerda de ellos;",
          "no pasa por alto el clamor de los afligidos."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Jet"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ten compasión de mí, Señor;",
          "mira cómo me afligen los que me odian.",
          "Sácame de las puertas de la muerte,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "para que en las puertas de Jerusalén",
          "proclame tus alabanzas y me regocije en tu salvación."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Tet"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Han caído los paganos",
          "en la fosa que han cavado;",
          "sus pies quedaron atrapados",
          "en la red que ellos mismos escondieron."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Al Señor se le conoce porque imparte justicia;",
          "el malvado cae en la trampa que él mismo tendió."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Higaión. Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Yod"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Bajan al sepulcro los malvados,",
          "todos los paganos que de Dios se olvidan."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Caf"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Pero el necesitado no será olvidado para siempre,",
          "ni para siempre se perderá la esperanza del pobre."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¡Levántate, Señor!",
          "No dejes que el hombre prevalezca;",
          "¡haz que las naciones comparezcan ante ti!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Infúndeles terror, Señor;",
          "¡que los pueblos sepan que son simples mortales!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
